{"title":"Bowling league season finale","genre":"creative production","brief":"Complete the following real project in the current, initially empty directory. Choose the deliverables, media, tools, structure and implementation that serve the intended user. Build usable artifacts and check your work. Deliver the project itself. Omit personally identifying credits, author signatures and model or toolchain identity labels. No network access or credentials are provided.\n\nCreate a cohesive event package for the final night of a six-team recreational bowling league. The audience includes regular players and family members who have never attended. Doors open at 6 p.m., warmups start at 6:20, two games start at 6:40, and recognition begins at 8:30. The league will recognize highest single game, most improved average, and the team spirit vote. Results arrive during the evening. Choose artifacts that guide spectators and let the host insert winners quickly. The venue has one widescreen TV and a letter-size printer.","works":{"ac3c153b0f9ea624":{"files":[{"name":"Final Night.html","bytes":7993,"sha256":"ac6d4c18e444224a2fbb1b3514913dc682f243e74b31653c03dcc3e6f9cb7c14","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Final Night • Host desk</title>\n<style id=\"styles\">\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;color:#132f2c;background:#f7f5e9;font:16px/1.45 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:32px 5% 60px}h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}h1{font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,68px);letter-spacing:-.07em;line-height:1}h2{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:24px 0 8px}.eyebrow,.label{font:bold 12px/1.3 monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.eyebrow{border-top:6px solid #133633;padding-top:14px;margin-bottom:10px}button,input,select{font:inherit}button,select,input{border:1px solid #57756c;border-radius:4px;padding:9px 12px}button{background:#133633;color:white;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{background:#687a72;cursor:default}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #cf4a28;outline-offset:2px}.bar{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0}.tip{font-size:14px}.card{padding:15px 0;border-top:1px solid #adbaac;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr 1fr auto;gap:12px;align-items:end}.card h3{font-size:18px;align-self:center}.card label{font-size:13px;font-weight:bold}.card input{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:4px;background:white}.preview{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9}.stage{container-type:inline-size;background:#102f2b;color:#fff9e5;position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden}.frame{height:100%;padding:4.1% 5.5%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative}.mast,.foot,.kicker{font:700 1.55cqw/1.2 monospace;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.mast,.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.mast{border-top:.45cqw solid #acf2bc;padding-top:1.25cqw}.foot{margin-top:auto;border-top:1px solid #729388;padding-top:1.2cqw}.art{position:absolute;right:3%;top:19%;width:35%;height:56%}.hero{margin:auto 0;max-width:60%;position:relative}.kicker{color:#acf2bc;margin-bottom:1.2cqw}.headline{font:bold 9.4cqw/.91 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.075em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.sub{overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:2.5cqw;line-height:1.2;margin-top:1.65cqw;max-width:92%}.times{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1.6cqw;margin-bottom:2.3cqw}.times div{border-top:.35cqw solid #f77e50;padding-top:.55cqw;font-size:1.85cqw}.times b{display:block;font:700 3.1cqw/1.15 monospace}.winner .hero{max-width:86%}.winner .art{opacity:.14}.winner .headline{font-size:6.7cqw}.screen{height:100vh;background:#071a17;display:grid;place-items:center}.screen .stage{width:min(100vw,177.7778vh);height:min(100vh,56.25vw)}@media(max-width:760px){.card{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.card h3{grid-column:1/-1}.card button{justify-self:start}}\n</style>\n<main><div class=\"eyebrow\">Six-team bowling league / Final night</div><h1>Host desk</h1>\n<h2>Before doors open</h2><p>Print the spectator guide at actual size on US Letter. Set the TV as an extended display. Open the TV window, move it to the TV, then double-click the slide for full screen. Press Esc to leave full screen.</p>\n<div class=\"bar\"><button id=\"launch\">Open TV window ↗</button><span id=\"status\" role=\"status\">TV window closed</span></div>\n<h2>On screen</h2><div class=\"bar\"><label for=\"cue\">Evening cue</label><select id=\"cue\"></select><button id=\"show\">Show cue</button></div><div class=\"preview\"><div class=\"stage\" id=\"preview\"></div></div>\n<h2>Recognition desk</h2><p class=\"tip\">Enter confirmed results here. Each reveal button sends that award to the screen immediately. Edit and reveal again to make a correction. Return to the Recognition cue between awards.</p><div id=\"awards\"></div><p class=\"tip\" id=\"save\"></p>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst cues=[\n['Doors open','Final night','Six teams. Two games. Welcome to the lanes.'],\n['Warmups','Warmups','Watch the bowlers find their line. Game one starts at 6:40 p.m.'],\n['Game one','Game one','Follow a bowler through ten frames. Look for X on the scoreboard after a strike.'],\n['Game two','Game two','Look for / on the scoreboard when a bowler clears the remaining pins on the second ball.'],\n['Recognition','Recognition','Highest single game • Most improved average • Team spirit vote'],\n['Closing','Thanks for cheering!','A round of applause for all six teams and the families who joined them.']\n];\nconst awards=['Highest single game','Most improved average','Team spirit vote'];\nconst art='<svg class=\"art\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 270\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#acf2bc\" stroke-width=\"5\"><path d=\"M8 254L178 84M43 254L202 95M78 254L223 109\"/></g><circle cx=\"203\" cy=\"108\" r=\"94\" fill=\"#ff875d\"/><g fill=\"#102f2b\"><circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"69\" r=\"12\"/><circle cx=\"221\" cy=\"65\" r=\"12\"/><circle cx=\"212\" cy=\"100\" r=\"15\"/></g></svg>';\nconst esc=s=>s.replace(/[&<>\"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[c]));\nlet tv,slide='',drafts=awards.map(()=>['','']);\ntry{const d=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('six-team-final-drafts'));if(Array.isArray(d)&&d.length===3&&d.every(r=>Array.isArray(r)&&r.length===2&&r.every(v=>typeof v==='string')))drafts=d}catch{}\nconst el=id=>document.getElementById(id);\nfunction render(k,title,sub,opening=false,winner=false){\nslide='<div class=\"frame '+(winner?'winner':'')+'\"><div class=\"mast\"><span>League bowling</span><span>Final night</span></div>'+art+'<div class=\"hero\"><div class=\"kicker\">'+esc(k)+'</div><div class=\"headline\">'+esc(title)+'</div>'+(sub?'<div class=\"sub\">'+esc(sub)+'</div>':'')+'</div>'+(opening?'<div class=\"times\"><div><b>6:00</b>Doors open</div><div><b>6:20</b>Warmups</div><div><b>6:40</b>Two games</div><div><b>8:30</b>Recognition</div></div>':'')+'<div class=\"foot\"><span>Six-team league</span><span>'+(opening?'All times p.m.':'Season finale')+'</span></div></div>';\nel('preview').innerHTML=slide;if(tv&&!tv.closed)tv.document.querySelector('.stage').innerHTML=slide;\n}\nfunction cue(){const i=Number(el('cue').value);render(i===0?'Tonight at the lanes':cues[i][0]==='Recognition'?'Awards ceremony':'At the lanes',cues[i][1],cues[i][2],i===0)}\ncues.forEach(([name],i)=>el('cue').add(new Option(name,i)));el('show').onclick=cue;cue();\nel('launch').onclick=()=>{tv=window.open('','leagueFinalTV','popup,width=1080,height=608');if(!tv){el('status').textContent='Allow pop-ups for this file, then open the TV window again.';return}tv.document.open();tv.document.write('<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>League bowling • Final night</title><style>'+el('styles').textContent+'</style><body class=\"screen\"><div class=\"stage\">'+slide+'</div></body></html>');tv.document.close();tv.document.ondblclick=()=>{if(!tv.document.fullscreenElement)tv.document.documentElement.requestFullscreen?.().catch(()=>{})};el('status').textContent='TV window open'};\nsetInterval(()=>{if(tv&&tv.closed){tv=null;el('status').textContent='TV window closed'}},1000);\nawards.forEach((name,i)=>{const box=document.createElement('div');box.className='card';box.innerHTML='<h3>'+name+'</h3><label>Winner<input maxlength=\"48\" placeholder=\"Name or team\"></label><label>'+['Score','Average gain','Detail'][i]+' (optional)<input maxlength=\"40\" placeholder=\"'+['e.g. 214 pins','e.g. +18 pins','e.g. fan favorite'][i]+'\"></label><button>Reveal award</button>';el('awards').append(box);const inputs=box.querySelectorAll('input'),btn=box.querySelector('button');btn.setAttribute('aria-label','Reveal '+name);inputs.forEach((input,j)=>{input.value=drafts[i][j];input.oninput=()=>{drafts[i][j]=input.value;btn.disabled=!inputs[0].value.trim();try{localStorage.setItem('six-team-final-drafts',JSON.stringify(drafts));el('save').textContent='Drafts saved in this browser.'}catch{el('save').textContent='Keep this desk open to retain your drafts.'}}});btn.disabled=!inputs[0].value.trim();btn.onclick=()=>render(name,inputs[0].value.trim(),inputs[1].value.trim(),false,true)});\n</script></html>\n"},{"name":"Spectator Guide.pdf","bytes":11783,"sha256":"c2c79d3d6d02cc8c1bd190149adb92109ecd6d6d12bcd37b772615e0d43a65a3","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/c2c79d3d6d02cc8c1bd190149adb92109ecd6d6d12bcd37b772615e0d43a65a3-page1.jpg"}],"download":"data/release/assets/79e04a1d1f20236271433967b58001ef8a29cf6da1ced2342183cb4ae2eca5d9.zip"},"82bc3464724cc9fb":{"files":[{"name":"Final Night.html","bytes":22260,"sha256":"b50c6c0d2c3baca6026dd7f7addfbec851acc4cba48e830e575a7d65a0f0922d","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Bowling League Final Night</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    color-scheme: light;\n    --paper: #faf1df;\n    --ink: #182725;\n    --green: #16483f;\n    --orange: #a33319;\n    --line: #b9b6a4;\n    font-family: \"Avenir Next\", \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n  body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); }\n  button, input { font: inherit; }\n  button {\n    cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid var(--green); border-radius: .35rem;\n    padding: .58rem .85rem; background: #fffaf0; color: var(--green); font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  button:hover { background: #e9e4d4; }\n  button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #be471e; outline-offset: 3px; }\n  button.primary, button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { background: var(--green); color: white; }\n  button.primary:hover, button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]:hover { background: #246655; }\n  .host { max-width: 76rem; margin: auto; padding: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem); }\n  .host-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 1rem; }\n  .host h1 { margin: .25rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.055em; }\n  .eyebrow { font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .15em; }\n  .host-head .eyebrow { color: var(--orange); font-size: .78rem; margin: 0; }\n  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; }\n  .host-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.65fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; align-items: start; }\n  .section-title { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0 0 .65rem; }\n  .helper { font-size: .91rem; margin: .5rem 0 .9rem; }\n  .award-editor { margin: 0 0 .65rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .4rem; padding: .8rem; background: #fffaf0; }\n  .award-editor h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 .65rem; }\n  .fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: .6rem; }\n  label { font-size: .81rem; font-weight: 700; display: block; }\n  input {\n    width: 100%; border: 1px solid #777d70; background: white; color: var(--ink);\n    border-radius: .25rem; padding: .4rem .5rem; display: block; margin-top: .2rem;\n  }\n  .editor-foot { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .45rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: .55rem; }\n  .editor-foot button { padding: .35rem .55rem; font-size: .85rem; }\n  .row-state { font-size: .78rem; margin-left: auto; color: #3f514a; }\n  .status { min-height: 1.4em; margin: .6rem 0 0; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 650; }\n  .reset { margin-top: .6rem; }\n  .preview-frame { margin-top: .65rem; border: 1px solid var(--green); }\n  .stage {\n    position: relative; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; container-type: inline-size;\n    background: var(--paper); overflow: hidden; color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  .slide { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 3.25cqw 4.8cqw 3.05cqw; }\n  .slide-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: .13cqw solid currentColor; padding-bottom: .85cqw; font-size: 1.35cqw; }\n  .league-mark { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8cqw; }\n  .mark { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, .33cqw); gap: .19cqw; transform: skew(-17deg); }\n  .mark i { height: 1.15cqw; background: currentColor; }\n  .schedule-main { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .53fr; align-items: center; flex: 1; min-height: 0; }\n  .schedule .title {\n    font-size: 13cqw; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.06em; line-height: .79;\n    margin: 0 0 .6cqw -.64cqw; text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .schedule .title span { display: block; color: var(--green); }\n  .scene {\n    position: relative; width: 29cqw; height: 28cqw; justify-self: end;\n    background: var(--green); border-radius: 48% 48% 3% 3%; overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .lane { position: absolute; inset: auto 0 0; height: 8cqw; background: #246452; clip-path: polygon(35% 0, 65% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%); }\n  .lane::before, .lane::after { content: \"\"; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 50%; width: .1cqw; height: 11cqw; background: #82aa88; transform-origin: top; transform: rotate(27deg) translateX(-2.3cqw); }\n  .lane::after { transform: rotate(-27deg) translateX(2.3cqw); }\n  .pin {\n    position: absolute; width: 5.8cqw; height: 14.8cqw; background: var(--paper);\n    clip-path: polygon(39% 1%, 49% 0, 62% 2%, 71% 7%, 73% 15%, 67% 25%, 66% 34%, 71% 43%, 85% 55%, 97% 69%, 100% 80%, 96% 89%, 83% 98%, 17% 98%, 4% 89%, 0 80%, 3% 69%, 15% 55%, 29% 43%, 34% 34%, 33% 25%, 27% 15%, 29% 7%);\n    background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 23%, #c94d2b 23% 28%, transparent 28% 31%, #c94d2b 31% 36%, transparent 36%);\n  }\n  .pin-left { top: 6.6cqw; left: 5.1cqw; transform: rotate(-22deg) scale(.87); }\n  .pin-right { top: 6.5cqw; right: 5cqw; transform: rotate(22deg) scale(.87); }\n  .pin-center { top: 4.05cqw; left: 11.6cqw; transform: rotate(-5deg); }\n  .ball { position: absolute; width: 8.7cqw; height: 8.7cqw; bottom: 2.25cqw; left: 10.3cqw; border-radius: 50%; background: #ed7951; box-shadow: inset -.6cqw -.7cqw #c84d2b; transform: rotate(-12deg); }\n  .ball i { display: block; width: .69cqw; height: .69cqw; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ink); position: absolute; left: 3.15cqw; top: 1.9cqw; }\n  .ball i:nth-child(2) { left: 4.53cqw; top: 1.9cqw; }\n  .ball i:nth-child(3) { left: 3.82cqw; top: 3.29cqw; }\n  .times { padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); list-style: none; margin: 0; border-block: .13cqw solid var(--ink); }\n  .times li { padding: .88cqw 1.3cqw 1.02cqw; border-left: .08cqw solid var(--line); }\n  .times li:first-child { padding-left: 0; border-left: 0; }\n  .times li:last-child { color: var(--orange); }\n  .times b { display: block; font-size: 4.1cqw; line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.04em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .times small { font-size: 1.35cqw; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 0; }\n  .times span { display: block; font-size: 1.57cqw; font-weight: 700; }\n  .schedule-footer { margin: 1.05cqw 0 0; font-size: 1.45cqw; font-weight: 600; }\n  .recognition { background: var(--green); color: var(--paper); }\n  .recognition .slide-head { color: #efb99e; }\n  .recognition h2 { margin: 1.7cqw 0 1.6cqw -.35cqw; font-size: 7.85cqw; letter-spacing: -.052em; line-height: 1; }\n  .results { display: grid; flex: 1; grid-template-rows: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n  .result {\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 30% 1fr; gap: 1.45cqw; align-items: center;\n    border-top: .1cqw solid #91a99a; min-width: 0; padding: .7cqw 0;\n  }\n  .result:last-child { border-bottom: .1cqw solid #91a99a; }\n  .category { font-size: 2.05cqw; line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 750; }\n  .result-name { font-size: 4.15cqw; line-height: 1.03; font-weight: 850; display: block; letter-spacing: -.024em; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n  .result-name.long { font-size: 3.05cqw; }\n  .result-name.extra-long { font-size: 2.55cqw; }\n  .result-name.pending { font-size: 2.1cqw; color: #c6d8c9; letter-spacing: 0; font-weight: 550; }\n  .result-detail { color: #ffd1b7; font-size: 1.65cqw; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 700; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n  .recognition-footer { margin: 1cqw 0 0; font-size: 1.55cqw; font-weight: 600; }\n  .tv-view { height: 100vh; background: #111a18; display: grid; grid-template-rows: 1fr auto; }\n  .tv-frame { display: grid; place-items: center; min-height: 0; }\n  .tv-frame .stage { width: min(100vw, calc((100vh - 3.25rem) * 16 / 9)); }\n  .dock { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .6rem; height: 3.25rem; }\n  .dock button { padding: .38rem .7rem; }\n  :fullscreen .tv-view, :-webkit-full-screen .tv-view { grid-template-rows: 1fr; }\n  :fullscreen .dock, :-webkit-full-screen .dock { display: none; }\n  :fullscreen .tv-frame .stage, :-webkit-full-screen .tv-frame .stage { width: min(100vw, calc(100vh * 16 / 9)); }\n  @media (max-width: 53rem) { .host-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n  @media (max-width: 28rem) { .fields { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"host\" id=\"host\" hidden>\n  <header class=\"host-head\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Bowling league · Final night</p>\n      <h1>Host desk</h1>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"actions\">\n      <button class=\"primary\" id=\"open-tv\" type=\"button\">Open TV display</button>\n      <button id=\"present-here\" type=\"button\">Present on this screen</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <p class=\"status\" id=\"status\" role=\"status\"></p>\n  <div class=\"host-grid\">\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"edit-title\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"edit-title\">Award results</h2>\n      <p class=\"helper\">Enter confirmed results as they arrive. When you’re ready to announce a winner, select <strong>Reveal winner</strong> to put that result on the TV. To enter joint winners, put both names in the same field.</p>\n      <div id=\"editors\"></div>\n      <button class=\"reset\" id=\"reset\" type=\"button\">Reset this event</button>\n    </section>\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"preview-title\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"preview-title\">TV preview</h2>\n      <div class=\"actions\" aria-label=\"TV screen\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-screen=\"schedule\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Schedule</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-screen=\"recognition\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Recognition</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"helper\">Select Recognition at 8:30 p.m. as the awards begin. The preview shows what the TV gets.</p>\n      <div class=\"preview-frame\" id=\"preview\"></div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<main class=\"tv-view\" id=\"tv-view\" hidden aria-label=\"Bowling league final night TV display\">\n  <div class=\"tv-frame\" id=\"tv-frame\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dock\">\n    <button type=\"button\" id=\"fullscreen\">Full screen</button>\n    <button type=\"button\" id=\"back\">Back to host desk</button>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<template id=\"stage-template\">\n  <div class=\"stage\">\n    <section class=\"slide schedule\" data-slide=\"schedule\" aria-label=\"Final night schedule\">\n      <header class=\"slide-head eyebrow\">\n        <span class=\"league-mark\"><span class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span> Bowling league</span>\n        <span>Six teams</span>\n      </header>\n      <div class=\"schedule-main\">\n        <h2 class=\"title\">Final<span>Night</span></h2>\n        <div class=\"scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"lane\"></div>\n          <div class=\"pin pin-left\"></div><div class=\"pin pin-right\"></div><div class=\"pin pin-center\"></div>\n          <div class=\"ball\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <ol class=\"times\">\n        <li><b>6:00 <small>PM</small></b><span>Doors open</span></li>\n        <li><b>6:20 <small>PM</small></b><span>Warmups</span></li>\n        <li><b>6:40 <small>PM</small></b><span>Two games begin</span></li>\n        <li><b>8:30 <small>PM</small></b><span>Recognition</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"schedule-footer\">Here to cheer? Watch from the seating behind the lanes and keep the approaches clear.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"slide recognition\" data-slide=\"recognition\" aria-label=\"Final night recognition\" hidden>\n      <header class=\"slide-head eyebrow\">\n        <span class=\"league-mark\"><span class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span> Bowling league · Final night</span>\n        <span>8:30 PM</span>\n      </header>\n      <h2>Recognition</h2>\n      <ul class=\"results\"></ul>\n      <p class=\"recognition-footer\">Thank you to all six teams and everyone who came to cheer.</p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<template id=\"editor-template\">\n  <form class=\"award-editor\">\n    <h3></h3>\n    <div class=\"fields\">\n      <label><span class=\"winner-label\"></span><input name=\"winner\" maxlength=\"64\" required autocomplete=\"off\"></label>\n      <label><span class=\"detail-label\"></span><input name=\"detail\" maxlength=\"35\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"editor-foot\">\n      <button class=\"reveal\" type=\"button\">Reveal winner</button>\n      <button class=\"hide-result\" type=\"button\" hidden>Hide result</button>\n      <span class=\"row-state\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n</template>\n\n<script>\n  'use strict';\n\n  const awards = [\n    { title: 'Highest single game', winnerLabel: 'Player name', detailLabel: 'Game score (optional)' },\n    { title: 'Most improved average', winnerLabel: 'Player name', detailLabel: 'Average gain (optional)' },\n    { title: 'Team spirit vote', winnerLabel: 'Team name', detailLabel: 'Vote result (optional)' }\n  ];\n  const storageKey = 'bowling-league-final-night-v1';\n  const messageKey = 'bowling-final-night';\n  const hasTvHash = location.hash === '#tv';\n  const find = (selector, root = document) => root.querySelector(selector);\n\n  function startState() {\n    return {\n      screen: 'schedule',\n      entries: awards.map(() => ({ draft: { winner: '', detail: '' }, published: null }))\n    };\n  }\n\n  function readResult(value) {\n    if (typeof value?.winner !== 'string' || typeof value?.detail !== 'string') return null;\n    return { winner: value.winner.slice(0, 64), detail: value.detail.slice(0, 35) };\n  }\n\n  let storageAvailable = true;\n  function restoreState() {\n    const fallback = startState();\n    try {\n      const saved = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(storageKey));\n      if (!Array.isArray(saved?.entries)) return fallback;\n      return {\n        screen: saved.screen === 'recognition' ? 'recognition' : 'schedule',\n        entries: fallback.entries.map((empty, i) => ({\n          draft: readResult(saved.entries[i]?.draft) ?? empty.draft,\n          published: readResult(saved.entries[i]?.published)\n        }))\n      };\n    } catch {\n      storageAvailable = false;\n      return fallback;\n    }\n  }\n\n  let state = hasTvHash ? startState() : restoreState();\n  let tvWindow = null;\n  const status = find('#status');\n\n  function announce(message = '') {\n    status.textContent = [message, storageAvailable ? '' : 'Browser storage is unavailable. Keep this host window open.'].filter(Boolean).join(' ');\n  }\n\n  function save() {\n    try {\n      localStorage.setItem(storageKey, JSON.stringify(state));\n      storageAvailable = true;\n    } catch {\n      storageAvailable = false;\n    }\n  }\n\n  function mountStage(parent) {\n    const stage = find('#stage-template').content.firstElementChild.cloneNode(true);\n    const resultList = find('.results', stage);\n    const rows = awards.map(({ title }) => {\n      const row = document.createElement('li');\n      row.className = 'result';\n      const category = document.createElement('span');\n      category.className = 'category';\n      category.textContent = title;\n      const copy = document.createElement('div');\n      const name = document.createElement('span');\n      const detail = document.createElement('span');\n      detail.className = 'result-detail';\n      copy.append(name, detail);\n      row.append(category, copy);\n      resultList.append(row);\n      return { name, detail };\n    });\n    parent.append(stage);\n    return { stage, rows };\n  }\n\n  function draw(display, data) {\n    const { stage, rows } = display;\n    for (const slide of stage.querySelectorAll('[data-slide]')) {\n      slide.hidden = slide.dataset.slide !== data.screen;\n    }\n    rows.forEach(({ name, detail }, i) => {\n      const result = data.results[i];\n      const winner = result?.winner || '';\n      name.className = 'result-name';\n      name.classList.toggle('pending', !winner);\n      name.classList.toggle('long', winner.length > 29);\n      name.classList.toggle('extra-long', winner.length > 49);\n      name.textContent = winner || 'To be announced';\n      detail.textContent = result?.detail || '';\n      detail.hidden = !detail.textContent;\n    });\n  }\n\n  const tv = mountStage(find('#tv-frame'));\n  const dock = find('#tv-view');\n  let preview = null;\n  const editors = [];\n\n  function publicState() {\n    return { screen: state.screen, results: state.entries.map(entry => entry.published) };\n  }\n\n  function sendToTv() {\n    if (tvWindow && !tvWindow.closed) {\n      tvWindow.postMessage({ key: messageKey, type: 'display', data: publicState() }, '*');\n    }\n  }\n\n  function refresh() {\n    const data = publicState();\n    draw(preview, data);\n    draw(tv, data);\n    for (const button of document.querySelectorAll('[data-screen]')) {\n      button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(button.dataset.screen === state.screen));\n    }\n    state.entries.forEach(({ draft, published }, i) => {\n      const { form, reveal, hide, indicator } = editors[i];\n      if (form.elements.winner.value !== draft.winner) form.elements.winner.value = draft.winner;\n      if (form.elements.detail.value !== draft.detail) form.elements.detail.value = draft.detail;\n      reveal.textContent = published ? 'Update TV result' : 'Reveal winner';\n      hide.hidden = !published;\n      const hasChanges = published && (published.winner !== draft.winner.trim() || published.detail !== draft.detail.trim());\n      indicator.textContent = hasChanges ? 'On recognition screen · draft changes' : published ? 'On recognition screen' : draft.winner || draft.detail ? 'Draft' : 'Awaiting result';\n    });\n    sendToTv();\n  }\n\n  function showTv() {\n    find('#host').hidden = true;\n    dock.hidden = false;\n  }\n\n  function showHost() {\n    dock.hidden = true;\n    find('#host').hidden = false;\n  }\n\n  async function enterFullscreen() {\n    const page = document.documentElement;\n    const request = page.requestFullscreen || page.webkitRequestFullscreen;\n    if (request) {\n      try {\n        await request.call(page);\n        return;\n      } catch {\n        // Browser full-screen controls remain available.\n      }\n    }\n    find('#fullscreen').textContent = 'Use browser full screen';\n  }\n\n  find('#fullscreen').addEventListener('click', enterFullscreen);\n\n  if (hasTvHash) {\n    find('#back').hidden = true;\n    draw(tv, publicState());\n    showTv();\n    if (window.opener) {\n      window.addEventListener('message', event => {\n        const message = event.data;\n        if (event.source !== window.opener || message?.key !== messageKey || message.type !== 'display') return;\n        const data = message.data;\n        draw(tv, {\n          screen: data.screen === 'recognition' ? 'recognition' : 'schedule',\n          results: awards.map((award, i) => readResult(data.results[i]))\n        });\n      });\n      window.opener.postMessage({ key: messageKey, type: 'ready' }, '*');\n    }\n  } else {\n    showHost();\n    preview = mountStage(find('#preview'));\n\n    awards.forEach((award, i) => {\n      const form = find('#editor-template').content.firstElementChild.cloneNode(true);\n      const heading = find('h3', form);\n      heading.textContent = award.title;\n      heading.id = 'award-' + i;\n      form.setAttribute('aria-labelledby', heading.id);\n      find('.winner-label', form).textContent = award.winnerLabel;\n      find('.detail-label', form).textContent = award.detailLabel;\n      const reveal = find('.reveal', form);\n      const hide = find('.hide-result', form);\n      const indicator = find('.row-state', form);\n      const { winner, detail } = form.elements;\n\n      form.addEventListener('input', () => {\n        winner.setCustomValidity('');\n        state.entries[i].draft = { winner: winner.value, detail: detail.value };\n        save();\n        refresh();\n        if (!storageAvailable) announce();\n      });\n\n      form.addEventListener('submit', event => event.preventDefault());\n\n      reveal.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const result = { winner: winner.value.trim(), detail: detail.value.trim() };\n        if (!result.winner) {\n          winner.setCustomValidity('Enter a winner before revealing this award.');\n          winner.reportValidity();\n          return;\n        }\n        state.entries[i] = { draft: { ...result }, published: result };\n        state.screen = 'recognition';\n        save();\n        refresh();\n        announce(award.title + ' is on the recognition screen.');\n      });\n\n      hide.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        state.entries[i].published = null;\n        save();\n        refresh();\n        reveal.focus();\n        announce(award.title + ' is hidden. The draft is still available.');\n      });\n\n      find('#editors').append(form);\n      editors.push({ form, reveal, hide, indicator });\n    });\n\n    for (const button of document.querySelectorAll('[data-screen]')) {\n      button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        state.screen = button.dataset.screen;\n        save();\n        refresh();\n        announce(button.textContent + ' is selected for the TV.');\n      });\n    }\n\n    find('#open-tv').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (tvWindow && !tvWindow.closed) {\n        tvWindow.focus();\n        return;\n      }\n      const url = new URL(location.href);\n      url.hash = 'tv';\n      tvWindow = window.open(url.href, 'finalNightTV', 'popup,width=1120,height=680');\n      sendToTv();\n      announce(tvWindow ? 'TV window opened. Move it to the TV, then select Full screen there.' : 'The browser blocked the TV window. Allow pop-ups or select Present on this screen.');\n    });\n\n    window.addEventListener('message', event => {\n      if (tvWindow && event.source === tvWindow && event.data?.key === messageKey && event.data.type === 'ready') {\n        sendToTv();\n        announce('TV display connected. Move it to the TV and select Full screen there.');\n      }\n    });\n\n    find('#present-here').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      showTv();\n      find('#fullscreen').focus();\n    });\n    find('#back').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      showHost();\n      find('#present-here').focus();\n    });\n    find('#reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      if (!window.confirm('Clear all award drafts and displayed results, and return to the schedule?')) return;\n      state = startState();\n      for (const { form } of editors) form.elements.winner.setCustomValidity('');\n      save();\n      refresh();\n      announce('Event reset. The TV is back on the schedule.');\n    });\n\n    refresh();\n    announce();\n  }\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},{"name":"Host Run Sheet.pdf","bytes":85678,"sha256":"272bbc740c6449ea923d0c7473ced9bd5d6140b5faac493ba18d8a385be4d15c","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/272bbc740c6449ea923d0c7473ced9bd5d6140b5faac493ba18d8a385be4d15c-page1.jpg"},{"name":"START HERE.txt","bytes":1666,"sha256":"2500ea51550abcaaa9d4a93349d52094348abf50c9021730aa6043683ae2c3ae","kind":"text","body":"BOWLING LEAGUE FINAL NIGHT\nEvent setup\n\n1. Print Spectator Guide.pdf on US Letter paper, one copy per group or\n   family. Print one Host Run Sheet.pdf for the announcer. Both are\n   single-page handouts that can be printed in grayscale.\n\n2. Open Final Night.html in a desktop browser. It works offline. For\n   private entry during the event, connect the TV as an extended\n   display. Select Open TV display, move that window onto the TV,\n   and select Full screen there. Keep the host desk on your laptop.\n   Select Schedule for doors at 6:00 p.m.\n\n3. At 8:30 p.m., select Recognition. Enter the confirmed names into\n   the award fields as results arrive. The score, average gain and\n   vote result fields are optional. Select Reveal winner as you\n   announce each award. Published winners stay visible together.\n   Use Update TV result to correct an entry or Hide result to\n   withdraw it while you verify it.\n\nIf the TV mirrors your laptop or you have one screen, select Present on\nthis screen and then Full screen. To enter or reveal a result in private,\nswitch the TV away from the input or use the display blanking controls,\npress Esc to leave full screen, and select Back to host desk. After\nediting, return to full screen and restore the TV input. The host can\nalso announce directly from the printed run sheet.\n\nUse the same browser and file path during the event. Drafts and revealed\nresults are retained when browser storage is available. If rehearsing\nwith dummy results, use Reset this event before doors open. Reopening a\nclosed TV window from the host desk restores its current screen. If\nthe host desk reloads, select Open TV display to reconnect it.\n"},{"name":"Spectator Guide.pdf","bytes":84422,"sha256":"09e8adea55fdfee350c5173910e49e99969547d0e6e541740b4c63d7a6009d47","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/09e8adea55fdfee350c5173910e49e99969547d0e6e541740b4c63d7a6009d47-page1.jpg"}],"download":"data/release/assets/c5ad575cac4d3211a71e01a34070d594994519ee108aa8cfc5da0512e0b874ee.zip"}}}
